s.\"><rect class=\"f1 s-acc sw2\" x=\"55\" y=\"6\" width=\"220\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Macrophage presents the</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"41\" text-anchor=\"middle\">antigen on its surface</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M165 52L165 73\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect class=\"f1 s-acc sw2\" x=\"40\" y=\"76\" width=\"250\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T-helper cell with a receptor</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\">complementary to the antigen</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\">binds to it: activated</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M165 137L165 158\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect class=\"f1 s-acc sw2\" x=\"40\" y=\"161\" width=\"250\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T-helper cell divides by mitosis:</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a clone of T-helper cells forms</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"165\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\">and releases cytokines</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M84 222L84 257\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M254 222L254 257\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"94\" y=\"244\">cytokines</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"264\" y=\"244\">cytokines</text><rect class=\"f2 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"6\" y=\"260\" width=\"156\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B-lymphocyte with a</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\">complementary</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">receptor</text><rect class=\"f2 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"176\" y=\"260\" width=\"156\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T-killer cell with a</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\">complementary</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\">receptor</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M84 321L84 342\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M254 321L254 342\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect class=\"f1 s-acc sw2\" x=\"6\" y=\"345\" width=\"156\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Divides by mitosis:</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a clone of</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"84\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B cells</text><rect class=\"f1 s-acc sw2\" x=\"176\" y=\"345\" width=\"156\" height=\"59\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"365\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Divides by mitosis:</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\">a clone of</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"254\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T-killer cells</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M45 406L45 427\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M125 406L125 427\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M215 406L215 427\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M295 406L295 427\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect class=\"f3 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"6\" y=\"430\" width=\"78\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"45\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Plasma</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"45\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cells</text><rect class=\"f3 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"92\" y=\"430\" width=\"76\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"130\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Memory</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"130\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B cells</text><rect class=\"f3 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"176\" y=\"430\" width=\"78\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"215\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T-killer</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"215\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cells</text><rect class=\"f3 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"260\" y=\"430\" width=\"70\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"295\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Memory</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"295\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\">T cells</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M45 476L45 497\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M215 476L215 497\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect class=\"f2 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"6\" y=\"500\" width=\"78\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"45\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Secrete</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"45\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\">antibodies</text><rect class=\"f2 s-acc2 sw2\" x=\"176\" y=\"500\" width=\"150\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"tl\" x=\"251\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Destroy infected</text><text class=\"tl\" x=\"251\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\">body cells</text></svg><figcaption>Clonal selection and clonal expansion. Only the few lymphocytes whose receptors are complementary to the antigen are selected; each selected cell divides by mitosis to make a clone. Memory cells are kept for the secondary response.</figcaption></figure>"}